{"id":"414081","name":"西红柿疙瘩汤","author":"小不点_June","authorId":"10615518","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/414081/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"1小碗"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"1个"},{"name":"大葱","amount":"少量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"少量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"先准备底汤，西红柿，大葱。","img":"images/414081/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"西红柿切块。","img":"images/414081/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"大葱切成葱花。","img":"images/414081/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"油锅加热，放入一半葱花及少量酱油炒。","img":"images/414081/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量水。","img":"images/414081/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入柿子，烧开。","img":"images/414081/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"准备面疙瘩，加适量水在小盆，顺时针搅拌。","img":"images/414081/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"搅成雪花状。","img":"images/414081/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"等汤开锅，下入搅拌好的面疙瘩即可。","img":"images/414081/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再加入适量的盐鸡精，剩余的葱花即可。","img":"images/414081/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/414081/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}